# A Smudge on One's Record (windurst 12): Chasing Tales' completion sets the player local var Quest[2][12]mustZone
# (this quest's prefix), but this quest's offer reads quest:getMustZone, the char var of that name: so the offer is
# there at once, with no zone change (a kept quirk). The fame is raised before Chasing Tales' completion (225, then 255:
# level 4); Glyph Hanger is completed, so its sections do not answer Hariga-Origa. Chasing Tales completes on C# here
# (Furakku's 410), as its own traces prove it against its Lua.
lists WindurstWaters/Hariga-Origa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Furakku-Norakku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/410 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/413
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-16.5,-5.25,102.0
quest Windurst.GlyphHanger completed
quest Windurst.ChasingTales accepted
charvar Quest[2][13]Prog 1
keyitem OverdueBookNotificationChasingTales
keyitem ASongOfLove
fame Windurst 225
login
trigger Furakku-Norakku             # Chasing Tales, the song held: 410
finish                              # Chasing Tales completed (fame 255); local var Quest[2][12]mustZone 1
trigger Hariga-Origa                # available, Chasing Tales completed, fame level 4, the char var 0: 413 (the local var does not gate it)
finish option=1                     # declined: nothing
